{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22303","headline":"晏起 · 白居易","name":"晏起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟鸣庭树上，日照屋檐时。\n老去慵转极，寒来起尤迟。\n厚薄被适性，高低枕得宜。\n神安体稳暖，此味何人知。\n睡足仰头坐，兀然无所思。\n如未凿七窍，若都遗四肢。\n缅想长安客，早朝霜满衣。\n彼此各自适，不知谁是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}